hildren in France have been protesting the failing education system. Compared to many other countries, France invests heavily in education but critics say that the funds are not distributed fairly.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Eritrean troops in Ethiopia raise fears of a regional war</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1f1b9419934929853467fb0b610a118d89f82040f31787c7e514134a0d74de96</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:09Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T15:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eritrean-troops-in-ethiopia-raise-fears-of-a-regional-war/a-79615065--7e5ecaa4a4f1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eritrean-troops-in-ethiopia-raise-fears-of-a-regional-war/a-79615065?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ethiopia and Eritrea are trading blame for confrontations in Tigray amid international calls for restraint. Their respective allies have the potential to catapult the conflict into a regional war.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Macron and Steinmeier struggle to revive Franco-German ties</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5012d252d6c5ed2eddbe8aa6f83c2a2c6ddb1319d31f3f49bb56501ff0160243</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:09Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T15:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/macron-and-steinmeier-struggle-to-revive-franco-german-ties/a-79618635--64b747b714b9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/macron-and-steinmeier-struggle-to-revive-franco-german-ties/a-79618635?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Presidents Frank-Walter Steinmeier and Emmanuel Macron are about to step down from their offices. Their meeting in France made it clear how urgently the Franco-German partnership needs new momentum.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>US imposes sanctions aiming to 'dismantle' International Criminal Court</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6f1ff3f7654f39db178467b4c4972e658261a549714033a24a0aeab5e6b84cef</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:09Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T14:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-imposes-sanctions-aiming-to-dismantle-international-criminal-court/a-79618577--3c15e900b5b5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-imposes-sanctions-aiming-to-dismantle-international-criminal-court/a-79618577?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US has announced new sanctions on the International Criminal Court. It's the latest in a series of steps by the Donald Trump administration as it seeks to "dismantle" the intergovernmental organization.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Poland: Lifeline for Ukrainian refugees confronts donor fatigue and online abuse as anti-Ukrainian sentiment grows</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5fdebba03fcd818c088e9c5184f0a728750588f53a6a1cf0a00d00d654b347ee</id><updated>2026-10-11T20:24:09Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T12:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/poland-lifeline-for-ukrainian-refugees-confronts-donor-fatigue-and-online-abuse-as-anti-ukrainian-se/a-79613292--19cba8c4d4f1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/poland-lifeline-for-ukrainian-refugees-confronts-donor-fatigue-and-online-abuse-as-anti-ukrainian-sentiment-grows/a-79613292?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Ukrainian woman who fled the war in her country built a lifeline for refugees in Poland. Now her organization faces donor fatigue, funding cuts and rising hostility as support for Ukrainians in Poland wanes.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
